{"id":"3ab0cb9c4d36bc68","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-sequent-left-or.md","title":"Sequent Left Or","display":"df-sequent-left-or — Sequent Left Or","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-sequent-left-or","aliases":["72-df-sequent-left-or"],"display":"df-sequent-left-or — Sequent Left Or","depends_on":["[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §1.2.2 print11–12/PDF23–24; explicit relation presentation","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-sequent-left-or"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-sequent-left-or</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sequent-left-or — Sequent Left Or"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §1.2.2 print11–12/PDF23–24; explicit relation presentation"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a> 的五分量签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\">\\(X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma\">\\(X_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>有限序列以自然数为定义域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,A\">\\(\\Gamma,A\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\">\\(\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\Gamma\">\\(A,\\Gamma\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma\\)</span>。多个逗号按次序串接。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a> 的语法有序对。</li>\n<li>本文件的规则名均指推理实例关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle\">\\(\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle\">\\(\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lor L:=\\{\\operatorname{BInf}(\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\Gamma,B\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\Gamma,A\\lor B\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta):\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\prime,\\Delta\\prime\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lor L:=\\{\\operatorname{BInf}(\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\Gamma,B\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\Gamma,A\\lor B\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta):\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\prime,\\Delta\\prime\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关系中的所有参数均由集合构造绑定；零前提规则使用空前提序列。量词条件决定部分替换的合法定义域，本征变量见证保存在带标签实例中。此处给出LK的多后件版本；LJ的∨R另由Gentzen-system明确定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$ 是 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 的五分量签名；$X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)$，$\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma',\\Delta'$ 遍历 $\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma$，$A,B$ 遍历 $X_\\Sigma$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"有限序列以自然数为定义域，$\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}$；$\\Gamma,A$ 缩写 $\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle$，$A,\\Gamma$ 缩写 $\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma$。多个逗号按次序串接。$\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma$ 是 [[72-df-sequent-calculus]] 的语法有序对。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本文件的规则名均指推理实例关系；$\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle$，$\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle$，见 [[72-df-sequent-rule]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma',\\Delta'","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"A,\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\lor L:=\\{\\operatorname{BInf}(\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\Gamma,B\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,\\Gamma,A\\lor B\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta):\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma\\prime,\\Delta\\prime\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1891,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-left-or|df-sequent-left-or — Sequent Left Or]]"},{"id":"8f554f0bcad06152","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-sequent-left-or|df-sequent-left-or — Sequent Left Or]]"}],"outgoing":["f9452e4a7788a117","d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","3c073b947b255638"]}